<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan shares via Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan shares via Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday reflected a net buying stance of one million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed five million shares of sell orders against six million of buys, they said.</p>
<p>- Tokyo equities desk (813) 3432-9404</p>
